  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review (dev 100b6fbb6e): two-package fixture (aaa/zzz Config.Load, field typed *aaa.Config) gives h.cfg.Load() -> zzz Config.Load typed_field and m.Make().Load() -> zzz chained_return_type (both wrong) while var c *aaa.Config; c.Load() -> aaa (right). External-field sibling also holds: h.logger.Info with *slog.Logger -> repo mylog Logger.Info 0.85. Code moved to go.py:4567-4573 and 4706-4712; still target = candidates[0], external check after the lookup. MECHANISM: unqualified Type.Method key looked up as global candidates[0] without the type's package. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-punat,WI-garol."  # dd72
